    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  Also <i>A judge;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَاضٍ</span>. (K.)

